---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /work-with-me/
title: Work with me
description: "Commission a hiti or groundwater study, book a heritage walk for your group or bring robotics to your school. Services, process and how to reach me."
pageCss: wwm
pageJs: form

# Enquiry configuration. Topic values come from services.yml (`topic`); the
# entries below add the non-service choices, tie topics to the follow-up
# questions, and map short ?topic= values used elsewhere on the site.
# Everything is rendered into the page — form.js holds no copies of it.
enquiry:
  extraTopics:
    - topic: media
      title: Press and media
    - topic: other
      title: Something else
  # Follow-up question group → the topic values that show it.
  groups:
    walk: [heritage-walk]
    project: [heritage-engineering, groundwater]
    school: [education]
  # Short ?topic= values → a topic value (service slugs are accepted too).
  aliases:
    walk: heritage-walk
    walks: heritage-walk
    consultancy: heritage-engineering
    engineering: heritage-engineering
    hiti: heritage-engineering
    restoration: heritage-engineering
    study: groundwater
    recharge: groundwater
    water: groundwater
    school: education
    schools: education
    robotics: education
    stem: education
    writing: research-writing
    research: research-writing
    talk: speaking
    talks: speaking
    press: media
  # Budget bands from the old services enquiry form.
  budgetBands:
    - Under NPR 50,000
    - NPR 50,000 – 150,000
    - NPR 150,000 – 500,000
    - NPR 500,000+
    - International budget (US dollars)
---
{#-
  /work-with-me/ — services, process, enquiry, FAQ and contact on one page.
  Data: services.yml (items, process), faq.yml, clients.yml, site.yml
  (email, phone, whatsapp, replyTime, formspree, social), collections.walks.
  Styles: /assets/css/pages/wwm.css · Script: /assets/js/form.js (optional).

  #enquire has two branches, chosen at build time:
    site.formspree set   → the enquiry form. It posts to Formspree without JS;
                           form.js adds topic logic, inline validation and
                           sending in place.
    site.formspree empty → direct contact (email / WhatsApp / phone) plus a
                           short "what to include" brief per topic; form.js
                           pre-fills the email for the chosen topic.
  Both branches read ?topic= (values or aliases above) and ?walk=<walk slug>.
-#}
{%- macro req() -%}
<span class="field__req" aria-hidden="true">*</span><span class="visually-hidden"> (required)</span>
{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro err(id) -%}
<p class="field__error" id="{{ id }}-error" hidden>{% icon "close" %}<span data-error-text></span></p>
{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro pad(n) -%}{{ ("0" + n) if n < 10 else n }}{%- endmacro -%}

{%- set hasForm = site.formspree and (site.formspree | trim) -%}
{%- set eduService = services.items | where("topic", "education") | first -%}
{%- set domainFor = { "heritage-engineering": "water", "groundwater": "water", "heritage-walk": "heritage", "education": "education" } -%}
{%- set topicList = [] -%}
{%- for s in services.items %}{% set _ = topicList.push({ value: s.topic, title: s.title, slug: s.slug }) %}{% endfor -%}
{%- for t in enquiry.extraTopics %}{% set _ = topicList.push({ value: t.topic, title: t.title }) %}{% endfor -%}
{%- set mailSubject = "Enquiry via " + (site.url | replace("https://", "")) -%}
{#- Short visible labels (the full URLs break badly on phones). -#}
{%- set linkedinLabel = site.social.linkedin | replace("https://", "") | replace("www.", "") | replace("linkedin.com/", "") -%}
{%- set mediumLabel = site.social.medium | replace("https://", "") | replace("www.", "") | replace("medium.com/", "") -%}

{# ======================================================================= #}
{# 1. Hero — what this page is for, availability, quick contact           #}
{# ======================================================================= #}
<header class="page-hero page-hero--split wwm-hero">
  <div class="container page-hero__inner">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <ol>
        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
        <li><span aria-current="page">Work with me</span></li>
      </ol>
    </nav>
    <p class="eyebrow">Commissions · walks · school programmes</p>
    <h1 class="page-hero__title">Work with <em>me</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">Restoring a stone spout, planning groundwater recharge, bringing a group on a heritage walk or starting robotics in your school — tell me what you need and I’ll tell you plainly how I can help.</p>
    <div class="cluster page-hero__actions">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject={{ mailSubject | urlencode }}">{% icon "mail" %}Email me</a>
      <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="{{ site.whatsapp }}" rel="noopener">{% icon "whatsapp" %}Message on WhatsApp</a>
      <a class="link-arrow" href="{{ site.phoneHref }}">{% icon "phone" %}<span><span class="visually-hidden">Call </span><span class="nowrap">{{ site.phone }}</span></span></a>
    </div>
    <dl class="ledger ledger--compact page-hero__meta">
      <div><dt>Availability</dt><dd><span class="wwm-status">Open to new projects and collaborations</span></dd></div>
      <div><dt>Replies</dt><dd>{{ site.replyTime | capitalize }}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Fastest</dt><dd>WhatsApp, for anything urgent</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Based in</dt><dd>{{ site.location }}</dd></div>
    </dl>

    <div class="page-hero__aside">
      <nav class="wwm-index" aria-labelledby="wwm-index-title">
        <p class="label wwm-index__title" id="wwm-index-title">On this page</p>
        <ol class="wwm-index__list" role="list">
          <li><a href="#services"><span class="wwm-index__num" aria-hidden="true">01</span><span class="wwm-index__text">What I can help with</span>{% icon "arrow-right" %}</a></li>
          <li><a href="#process"><span class="wwm-index__num" aria-hidden="true">02</span><span class="wwm-index__text">How a project runs</span>{% icon "arrow-right" %}</a></li>
          <li><a href="#enquire"><span class="wwm-index__num" aria-hidden="true">03</span><span class="wwm-index__text">{{ "Send an enquiry" if hasForm else "Get in touch" }}</span>{% icon "arrow-right" %}</a></li>
          {%- if faq and faq.length %}
          <li><a href="#faq"><span class="wwm-index__num" aria-hidden="true">04</span><span class="wwm-index__text">Questions people ask</span>{% icon "arrow-right" %}</a></li>
          {%- endif %}
          <li><a href="#contact"><span class="wwm-index__num" aria-hidden="true">{{ "05" if (faq and faq.length) else "04" }}</span><span class="wwm-index__text">Contact details</span>{% icon "arrow-right" %}</a></li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>


{# ======================================================================= #}
{# 2. Services — a numbered register, one row per service                 #}
{# ======================================================================= #}
<section class="section wwm-services" id="services" aria-labelledby="services-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">01 · Services</p>
      <h2 id="services-title">What I can help with</h2>
      <p class="lede">I work with municipalities, non-profits, schools, researchers and visiting groups — from site surveys and computer-aided design (CAD) drawings to heritage walks and hands-on robotics workshops. If your project sits between two of these, tell me about it anyway.</p>
    </header>

    <nav class="wwm-jump" aria-label="Services on this page">
      <ul class="cluster cluster--tight wwm-jump__list" role="list">
        {%- for s in services.items %}
        <li><a class="link-arrow" href="#service-{{ s.slug }}">{{ s.title }}{% icon "arrow-right" %}</a></li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <ol class="wwm-register" role="list">
      {%- for s in services.items %}
      <li class="wwm-service" id="service-{{ s.slug }}"{% if domainFor[s.topic] %} data-domain="{{ domainFor[s.topic] }}"{% endif %}>
        <div class="wwm-service__mark" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="wwm-service__num">{{ pad(loop.index) }}</span>
          <span class="marker marker--icon wwm-service__icon">{% icon s.icon, "icon--l" %}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="wwm-service__main">
          <h3 class="wwm-service__title">{{ s.title }}</h3>
          <p class="wwm-service__summary">{{ s.summary }}</p>
          {%- if s.idealFor %}
          <dl class="wwm-service__ideal">
            <dt class="label">Ideal for</dt>
            <dd>{{ s.idealFor }}</dd>
          </dl>
          {%- endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="wwm-service__side">
          {%- if s.deliverables and s.deliverables.length %}
          <p class="label" id="service-{{ s.slug }}-get">What you get</p>
          <ul class="checklist" role="list" aria-labelledby="service-{{ s.slug }}-get">
            {%- for d in s.deliverables %}
            <li>{% icon "check" %}<span>{{ d }}</span></li>
            {%- endfor %}
          </ul>
          {%- endif %}
          <div class="cluster cluster--tight wwm-service__actions">
            <a class="link-arrow" href="{{ page.url }}?topic={{ s.topic }}#enquire" data-topic-link="{{ s.topic }}">Enquire about this<span class="visually-hidden">: {{ s.title }}</span>{% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
            {%- if s.topic == "heritage-walk" %}
            <a class="link-arrow wwm-service__more" href="/walks/">See the walks{% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
            {%- endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ol>

    {%- if clients and clients.length %}
    <div class="wwm-clients">
      <h3 class="label wwm-clients__title" id="clients-title">Worked with and for</h3>
      <div>
        {%- set clientsLabelledBy = "clients-title" %}
        {% include "partials/clients.njk" %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>


{# ======================================================================= #}
{# 3. Process — the four steps, left to right (top to bottom on phones)   #}
{# ======================================================================= #}
<section class="section section--alt wwm-process" id="process" aria-labelledby="process-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">02 · Process</p>
      <h2 id="process-title">How a project runs</h2>
      <p class="lede">The same four steps whether you’re booking a walk or commissioning a study — so you know the scope and the cost before any work starts.</p>
      <a class="link-arrow section-head__action" href="#enquire">Start with step 01{% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
    </header>
    <ol class="steps wwm-steps">
      {%- for p in services.process %}
      <li><h3 class="steps__title">{{ p.step }}</h3><p class="steps__text">{{ p.text }}</p></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>


{# ======================================================================= #}
{# 4. Enquire (#enquire) — the form, or direct contact while no form ID   #}
{# ======================================================================= #}
<section class="section wwm-enquire" id="enquire" aria-labelledby="enquire-title"
  data-enquiry
  data-topics="{{ topicList | dump }}"
  data-aliases="{{ enquiry.aliases | dump }}"
  data-email="{{ site.email }}">
  <div class="container wwm-enquire__grid">

    <div class="wwm-enquire__intro stack stack--l">
      <header class="stack stack--xs">
        <p class="eyebrow">03 · {{ "Enquire" if hasForm else "Get in touch" }}</p>
        <h2 id="enquire-title" data-enquiry-heading>Tell me what you need</h2>
        {%- if hasForm %}
        <p class="lede">A few lines is enough to start: what you need, where, and by when. I reply {{ site.replyTime }}, usually with a couple of questions or a time for the free 30-minute scoping call.</p>
        {%- else %}
        <p class="lede">The quickest way to reach me is email or WhatsApp. A few lines is enough to start — what you need, where, and by when — and I reply {{ site.replyTime }}.</p>
        {%- endif %}
      </header>

      <div class="notice notice--success" data-topic-note hidden>{% icon "check" %}<p>You’re asking about <strong data-topic-note-text></strong>.</p></div>

      <div class="stack stack--s">
        <p class="label" id="channels-title">{{ "Prefer to write directly?" if hasForm else "Ways to reach me" }}</p>
        <ul class="wwm-channels" role="list" aria-labelledby="channels-title">
          <li class="card card--link wwm-channel">
            <div class="card__body">
              <p class="card__meta"><span class="wwm-channel__kind">{% icon "mail" %}Email</span></p>
              <p class="card__title wwm-channel__value"><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject={{ mailSubject | urlencode }}" data-channel="email">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
              <p class="card__text">Best for briefs, documents and anything detailed.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="card card--link wwm-channel">
            <div class="card__body">
              <p class="card__meta"><span class="wwm-channel__kind">{% icon "whatsapp" %}WhatsApp</span></p>
              <p class="card__title wwm-channel__value"><a href="{{ site.whatsapp }}" rel="noopener" data-channel="whatsapp"><span class="visually-hidden">WhatsApp </span><span class="nowrap">{{ site.phone }}</span></a></p>
              <p class="card__text">Fastest for anything urgent.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="card card--link wwm-channel">
            <div class="card__body">
              <p class="card__meta"><span class="wwm-channel__kind">{% icon "phone" %}Phone</span></p>
              <p class="card__title wwm-channel__value"><a href="{{ site.phoneHref }}" data-channel="phone"><span class="visually-hidden">Call </span><span class="nowrap">{{ site.phone }}</span></a></p>
              <p class="card__text">Call me directly.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    {%- if hasForm %}
    {# ---------------- 4a. Enquiry form (Formspree) ---------------- #}
    <div class="card band--edge wwm-sheet">
      <div class="wwm-sheet__head" data-enquiry-head>
        <h3 class="wwm-sheet__title" id="enquiry-form-title">Enquiry</h3>
        <p class="label" aria-hidden="true"><span class="field__req">*</span> Required</p>
      </div>

      <form class="form wwm-form" id="enquiry-form" action="https://formspree.io/f/{{ site.formspree | trim }}" method="POST" accept-charset="utf-8" aria-labelledby="enquiry-form-title" data-enquiry-form>
        <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Website enquiry — {{ site.name }}" data-enquiry-subject data-subject-pattern="Website enquiry: {topic}">
        <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="{{ site.url }}/thanks/">
        <div class="visually-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
          <label for="enq-gotcha">Leave this field empty</label>
          <input type="text" id="enq-gotcha" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
        </div>

        <div class="form__row">
          <div class="field">
            <label class="field__label" for="enq-name">Your name{{ req() }}</label>
            <input id="enq-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="150" data-label="Your name" data-error-required="Please tell me your name.">
            {{ err("enq-name") }}
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label class="field__label" for="enq-email">Email{{ req() }}</label>
            <input id="enq-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" spellcheck="false" required maxlength="200" data-label="Email" data-error-required="Enter your email address so I can reply." data-error-format="Enter an email address like name@example.com.">
            {{ err("enq-email") }}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form__row">
          <div class="field">
            <label class="field__label" for="enq-org">Organisation <span class="field__optional">(optional)</span></label>
            <input id="enq-org" name="organisation" type="text" autocomplete="organization" maxlength="200">
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label class="field__label" for="enq-phone">Phone or WhatsApp <span class="field__optional">(optional)</span></label>
            <input id="enq-phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel" maxlength="40">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label class="field__label" for="enq-topic">What is it about?{{ req() }}</label>
          <p class="field__hint" id="enq-topic-hint">Pick the closest match. There are a few extra questions for walks, projects and schools.</p>
          <select id="enq-topic" name="topic" required aria-describedby="enq-topic-hint" data-enquiry-topic data-label="Topic" data-error-required="Choose what your enquiry is about.">
            <option value="">Choose one…</option>
            {%- for t in topicList %}
            <option value="{{ t.value }}">{{ t.title }}</option>
            {%- endfor %}
          </select>
          {{ err("enq-topic") }}
        </div>

        {#- Follow-up questions. Without JS all three show, each introduced by its
            legend. form.js shows only the group for the chosen topic and
            disables the others, so they are not sent. All are optional. -#}
        <fieldset class="wwm-box wwm-fieldset" data-group="walk" data-topics="{{ enquiry.groups.walk | join(' ') }}">
          <legend class="wwm-fieldset__legend"><span class="wwm-fieldset__q">If you’re booking a walk…</span><span class="label">All optional</span></legend>
          <div class="field">
            <label class="field__label" for="enq-walk">Which walk?</label>
            <select id="enq-walk" name="walk" data-enquiry-walk>
              <option value="">Not sure yet — help me choose</option>
              {%- for w in collections.walks %}
              <option value="{{ w.data.title }}" data-slug="{{ w.fileSlug }}">{{ w.data.title }}</option>
              {%- endfor %}
              <option value="A custom route">A custom route</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="form__row">
            <div class="field">
              <label class="field__label" for="enq-dates">Preferred dates</label>
              <p class="field__hint" id="enq-dates-hint">A date, a range or a month is fine.</p>
              <input id="enq-dates" name="preferred_dates" type="text" maxlength="200" aria-describedby="enq-dates-hint">
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="field__label" for="enq-group">Group size</label>
              <p class="field__hint" id="enq-group-hint">Roughly how many people.</p>
              <input id="enq-group" name="group_size" type="text" maxlength="60" aria-describedby="enq-group-hint">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label class="field__label" for="enq-language">Language</label>
            <p class="field__hint" id="enq-language-hint">Which language should the walk be in?</p>
            <input id="enq-language" name="walk_language" type="text" maxlength="120" aria-describedby="enq-language-hint">
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="wwm-box wwm-fieldset" data-group="project" data-topics="{{ enquiry.groups.project | join(' ') }}">
          <legend class="wwm-fieldset__legend"><span class="wwm-fieldset__q">If it’s a study or a restoration project…</span><span class="label">All optional</span></legend>
          <div class="field">
            <label class="field__label" for="enq-site">Site or location</label>
            <p class="field__hint" id="enq-site-hint">Where is the spout, site or land? A ward, town or district is enough to start.</p>
            <input id="enq-site" name="site_location" type="text" maxlength="200" aria-describedby="enq-site-hint">
          </div>
          <div class="form__row">
            <div class="field">
              <label class="field__label" for="enq-timeline">Timeline</label>
              <p class="field__hint" id="enq-timeline-hint">When do you need it by?</p>
              <input id="enq-timeline" name="timeline" type="text" maxlength="200" aria-describedby="enq-timeline-hint">
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="field__label" for="enq-budget">Budget band</label>
              <p class="field__hint" id="enq-budget-hint">In Nepalese rupees (NPR). A rough band helps me shape the proposal.</p>
              <select id="enq-budget" name="budget" aria-describedby="enq-budget-hint">
                <option value="">Prefer not to say</option>
                {%- for b in enquiry.budgetBands %}
                <option>{{ b }}</option>
                {%- endfor %}
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="wwm-box wwm-fieldset" data-group="school" data-topics="{{ enquiry.groups.school | join(' ') }}">
          <legend class="wwm-fieldset__legend"><span class="wwm-fieldset__q">If you’re a school…</span><span class="label">All optional</span></legend>
          <div class="form__row">
            <div class="field">
              <label class="field__label" for="enq-school">School name</label>
              <input id="enq-school" name="school_name" type="text" autocomplete="organization" maxlength="200">
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="field__label" for="enq-students">Students and grades</label>
              <p class="field__hint" id="enq-students-hint">Roughly how many students, and which grades.</p>
              <input id="enq-students" name="students_and_grades" type="text" maxlength="200" aria-describedby="enq-students-hint">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label class="field__label" for="enq-programme">What interests you?</label>
            <select id="enq-programme" name="programme_interest">
              <option value="">A mix, or not sure yet</option>
              {%- if eduService %}{% for d in eduService.deliverables %}
              <option>{{ d }}</option>
              {%- endfor %}{% endif %}
            </select>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <div class="field">
          <label class="field__label" for="enq-message">Your message{{ req() }}</label>
          <p class="field__hint" id="enq-message-hint">What you need, where, and by when. A few lines is plenty.</p>
          <textarea id="enq-message" name="message" rows="6" required maxlength="5000" aria-describedby="enq-message-hint" data-label="Your message" data-error-required="Write a few lines about what you need."></textarea>
          {{ err("enq-message") }}
        </div>

        <div class="form__actions wwm-form__actions">
          <button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit" data-enquiry-submit data-sending-label="Sending…"><span data-submit-label>Send enquiry</span>{% icon "arrow-right" %}</button>
          <div class="wwm-form__status" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-enquiry-status></div>
        </div>
        <p class="form__note">I reply {{ site.replyTime }}. Prefer email? Write to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
      </form>

      <div class="wwm-sent" data-enquiry-success hidden>
        <span class="marker marker--icon wwm-sent__mark" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "check", "icon--l" %}</span>
        <h3 class="wwm-sent__title" tabindex="-1" data-enquiry-success-heading>Thank you — your enquiry is on its way</h3>
        <p>I’ll reply {{ site.replyTime }}. If it’s urgent, WhatsApp is the fastest way to reach me.</p>
        <div class="cluster">
          <a class="link-arrow" href="{{ site.whatsapp }}" rel="noopener">{% icon "whatsapp" %}<span>Message on WhatsApp <span class="nowrap">{{ site.phone }}</span></span></a>
          <a class="link-arrow" href="/work/">See the work{% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      {#- Status messages, cloned into the live region by form.js. -#}
      <template data-enquiry-template="sending">
        <div class="notice">{% icon "clock" %}<p>Sending your enquiry…</p></div>
      </template>
      <template data-enquiry-template="invalid">
        <div class="notice notice--error">{% icon "close" %}<p><strong class="notice__title">A few details are missing</strong>Please check: <span data-slot="fields">the highlighted fields</span>.</p></div>
      </template>
      <template data-enquiry-template="error">
        <div class="notice notice--error">{% icon "close" %}<p><strong class="notice__title">That didn’t go through</strong>Please try again in a moment, or <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" data-enquiry-mailto>email me directly</a> — your message will be filled in for you.</p></div>
      </template>
    </div>

    {%- else %}
    {# ---------------- 4b. Direct contact (no form ID yet) ---------------- #}
    <div class="card band--edge wwm-sheet wwm-brief" data-enquiry-direct
      data-mail-subject="Enquiry: {topic}"
      data-mail-greeting="Hello Hrishav,"
      data-mail-prompts="Name and organisation|What I need|By when">
      <div class="wwm-sheet__head">
        <h3 class="wwm-sheet__title">What helps me reply quickly</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="wwm-brief__intro">Start with who you are, what you need and by when. Then, depending on what it’s about:</p>
      <div class="wwm-brief__groups">
        <div class="wwm-box wwm-brief__group" data-group="walk" data-topics="{{ enquiry.groups.walk | join(' ') }}">
          <h4 class="wwm-brief__title"><span class="label" aria-hidden="true">Walks</span> Booking a walk</h4>
          <ul class="checklist" role="list">
            <li data-prompt="Which walk">{% icon "check" %}<span>Which walk{% if collections.walks.length %} — {% for w in collections.walks %}<a href="{{ w.url }}">{{ w.data.title }}</a>{% if loop.revindex0 == 1 %} or {% elif not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %} —{% endif %} or a custom route</span></li>
            <li data-prompt="Preferred dates">{% icon "check" %}<span>Preferred dates</span></li>
            <li data-prompt="Group size">{% icon "check" %}<span>Group size</span></li>
            <li data-prompt="Language">{% icon "check" %}<span>The language for the walk</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="wwm-box wwm-brief__group" data-group="project" data-topics="{{ enquiry.groups.project | join(' ') }}">
          <h4 class="wwm-brief__title"><span class="label" aria-hidden="true">Studies</span> A study or restoration</h4>
          <ul class="checklist" role="list">
            <li data-prompt="Site or location">{% icon "check" %}<span>Where the site is</span></li>
            <li data-prompt="Timeline">{% icon "check" %}<span>Your timeline</span></li>
            <li data-prompt="Budget band">{% icon "check" %}<span>A rough budget in Nepalese rupees (NPR), if you have one</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="wwm-box wwm-brief__group" data-group="school" data-topics="{{ enquiry.groups.school | join(' ') }}">
          <h4 class="wwm-brief__title"><span class="label" aria-hidden="true">Schools</span> A school programme</h4>
          <ul class="checklist" role="list">
            <li data-prompt="School name">{% icon "check" %}<span>Your school’s name</span></li>
            <li data-prompt="Students and grades">{% icon "check" %}<span>Roughly how many students, and which grades</span></li>
            <li data-prompt="What interests you">{% icon "check" %}<span>What interests you{% if eduService and eduService.deliverables %} — {{ eduService.deliverables | join(", ") | lower }}{% endif %}</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="wwm-brief__foot">
        <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject={{ mailSubject | urlencode }}" data-channel="email">{% icon "mail" %}Write the email</a>
        <p class="form__note">Opens your email app, addressed to {{ site.email }}.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- endif %}

  </div>
</section>


{# ======================================================================= #}
{# 5. FAQ                                                                  #}
{# ======================================================================= #}
{%- if faq and faq.length %}
<section class="section section--alt wwm-faq" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="container wwm-faq__grid">
    <header class="section-head wwm-faq__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">04 · Questions</p>
      <h2 id="faq-title">Questions people ask first</h2>
      <p class="lede">Something not covered here? Ask me directly by <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">email</a> or <a href="{{ site.whatsapp }}" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a>.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="faq wwm-faq__list">
      {%- for f in faq %}
      <details class="faq__item"{% if loop.first %} open{% endif %}>
        <summary>{{ f.question }}</summary>
        <div class="faq__answer"><p>{{ f.answer | safe }}</p></div>
      </details>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}


{# ======================================================================= #}
{# 6. Contact details ledger                                               #}
{# ======================================================================= #}
<section class="section wwm-contact" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <div class="container wwm-contact__grid">
    <div class="wwm-contact__main">
      <header class="section-head wwm-contact__head">
        <p class="eyebrow">05 · Contact details</p>
        <h2 id="contact-title">Where to find me</h2>
        <p class="lede">I’m based in Mangalbazar, Lalitpur. Field work happens here in the Kathmandu Valley; research, documentation and writing can be done remotely.</p>
      </header>
      <dl class="ledger wwm-contact__ledger">
        <div><dt>Email</dt><dd><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></dd></div>
        <div><dt>WhatsApp</dt><dd><a class="nowrap" href="{{ site.whatsapp }}" rel="noopener">{{ site.phone }}</a></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Phone</dt><dd><a class="nowrap" href="{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Location</dt><dd>{{ site.location }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Replies</dt><dd>{{ site.replyTime | capitalize }}</dd></div>
        {%- if site.social.linkedin %}
        <div><dt>LinkedIn</dt><dd><a href="{{ site.social.linkedin }}" rel="me noopener">{{ linkedinLabel }}</a></dd></div>
        {%- endif %}
        {%- if site.social.medium %}
        <div><dt>Medium</dt><dd><a href="{{ site.social.medium }}" rel="me noopener">{{ mediumLabel }}</a></dd></div>
        {%- endif %}
        {%- if site.cv | fileExists %}
        <div><dt>CV</dt><dd><a href="{{ site.cv }}" download>Download my CV (PDF)</a></dd></div>
        {%- endif %}
        {%- if site.necLine %}
        <div><dt>Registration</dt><dd>{{ site.necLine }}</dd></div>
        {%- endif %}
      </dl>
    </div>
    <div class="wwm-contact__aside">
      {% media "/assets/images/portrait/hrishav-raj-joshi.jpg", "Hrishav Raj Joshi", { ratio: "4/5", kind: "portrait", focus: "top", class: "media--framed", sizes: "(min-width: 56rem) 20rem, 80vw" } %}
      <p class="label wwm-contact__coords">{{ site.locality }} · {{ site.coordinates.lat }}° N · {{ site.coordinates.lng }}° E</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
